{"When credentials.totpCode is provided, password verification at line 121 is skipped because the condition 'user.password && !credentials.totpCode' evaluates to false. An attacker can provide a valid backupCode at line 131 to authenticate without knowing the user's password - password verification should be required before accepting any 2FA factor": 0.7931369543075562, "When req.body.backupCode is a truthy non-string value (e.g., { backupCode: 123 }), the code calls .replaceAll(\"-\", \"\") on it at line 61, which throws TypeError and crashes the request because the check on line 48 only tests truthiness, not that the value is a string": 0.6857739686965942}